      "cooked": "<p>Hi here in my custom doctype, their are 8 columns in the section.<br>\nIn doctype form builder and preview it works fine.<br>\nBut in actual form they are overlapping.<br>\nI have tried setting the columns and width fields but none works.<br>\nKindly tell me what’s the issue and how can I resolve it.</p>\n<div class=\"d-image-grid\">\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/4/04418dec22d460a4c9a25ac4b901e9711a07ef8b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/04418dec22d460a4c9a25ac4b901e9711a07ef8b\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-08-22 114518\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/4/04418dec22d460a4c9a25ac4b901e9711a07ef8b_2_690x153.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-08-22 114518\" data-base62-sha1=\"BEmhVxBMgEdIFsOkKQhVo3aDlV\" width=\"690\" height=\"153\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/4/04418dec22d460a4c9a25ac4b901e9711a07ef8b_2_690x153.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/4/04418dec22d460a4c9a25ac4b901e9711a07ef8b_2_1035x229.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/4/04418dec22d460a4c9a25ac4b901e9711a07ef8b_2_1380x306.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1D1D1D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-08-22 114518</span><span class=\"informations\">1465×326 20.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/7/770562d6f4095cfc640726eb4f9ff959c65ab8bd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/770562d6f4095cfc640726eb4f9ff959c65ab8bd\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-08-22 1144